## Phase 1 Analysis: Marcus Velez on AI ROI

---

### 1. The Villain

Most organizations measure AI ROI using a 1990s software-implementation lens — cost savings and headcount reduction — and in doing so capture only 20-30% of the value their AI programs could deliver. The remaining 70-80% (strategic differentiation, organizational intelligence) goes unmeasured, and therefore unpursued.

---

