### 8. Recommended Title Options

1. **"Your AI ROI Framework Is the Problem"** — Most direct. Takes a position against CFO intuition. Forces a click from anyone who is currently using a traditional ROI lens. Highest risk, highest reward.

2. **"Why 70% of Your AI Investment Is Invisible on Your ROI Dashboard"** — Leads with the specific loss, not the diagnosis. Strong for search intent. May read as slightly clickbait-adjacent but the claim is defensible.

3. **"The Wrong Scorecard: How Enterprise AI Programs Measure the 30% and Miss the 70%"** — More analytical frame. Works well for an audience that responds to "here's what your data is missing." Slightly longer for a title but memorable.

**Recommendation:** Option 1 as the primary title. Option 2 as an A/B test for email/social distribution.

